    //
    // For a fixed split, any sequence interleaving the two parts while
    // preserving internal order is achievable, giving C(N-1, size_left).
    //
    // Thus answer is:
    //   C(N-1, K-1) if the two split points coincide
    //   2*C(N-1, K-1) otherwise
    //
    // They coincide iff K+1 = N-K+2 <=> 2K = N+1.

